{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The issue was in `moving_average` in `repo/series.py`. The loop used `range(len(values) - w)`, so it stopped before the last full window.\n\nFor window size 2 on `[1, 2, 3, 4]`, that produced only `[1.5, 2.5]` (windows ending at 2 and 3) and dropped the window `[3, 4]` → `3.5`, which is why the chart looked one point short.\n\nThe loop is now `range(len(values) - w + 1)`, which includes every valid starting index. `mavg_summary` in `repo/rows.py` already uses this helper, so charts get the full series without other changes.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible/test_mavg.py` pass."}]},"session_id":"0244fb36-a6fb-4a96-904d-c7fe57d771cb"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":31036,"duration_api_ms":31036,"is_error":false,"result":"Searching the codebase for moving-average chart logic.\n\n\nThe loop uses `range(len(values) - w)`, which omits the final window. Verifying with tests and applying the fix.\n\n\nThe issue was in `moving_average` in `repo/series.py`. The loop used `range(len(values) - w)`, so it stopped before the last full window.\n\nFor window size 2 on `[1, 2, 3, 4]`, that produced only `[1.5, 2.5]` (windows ending at 2 and 3) and dropped the window `[3, 4]` → `3.5`, which is why the chart looked one point short.\n\nThe loop is now `range(len(values) - w + 1)`, which includes every valid starting index. `mavg_summary` in `repo/rows.py` already uses this helper, so charts get the full series without other changes.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible/test_mavg.py` pass.","session_id":"0244fb36-a6fb-4a96-904d-c7fe57d771cb","request_id":"53daffbe-9383-4786-9e78-4c6c50231578","usage":{"inputTokens":11429,"outputTokens":830,"cacheReadTokens":46540,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
